WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.470
- It's very, very scary

00:00:02.774 --> 00:00:06.330
to be judged by the color of your skin.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:09.650
It's happened to me quite
a bit my whole life,

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.490
you know what I mean?

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:15.487
Even how people describe me on Scrubs,

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.160
I'm the black guy from
Scrubs, you know what I mean?

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.570
I'm not even one of
the actors from Scrubs.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.440
I'm the black guy from Scrubs.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:27.750
And so I encourage everyone
to just, first of all,

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.040
educate yourself, that's most important.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:31.910
You know what I mean?

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:36.720
Once you educate yourself,
you'll be able to see that,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:40.090
you know, everyone
pretty much is the same.

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:44.700
We might do things differently,
but we all are the same

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:49.700
and together we can abolish
racism and it's everywhere.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.600
And also, once you recognize that,

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.980
once you recognize racism is
everywhere, it never left.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:59.270
It's always been here,
you know what I mean?

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:01.950
It's not a surprise that
this is going on right now.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:05.100
It's finally coming to a
head is what's happening.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.150
- Yeah.
- But it's been here forever.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:11.060
And once you start, once you
don't take that for granted

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.492
and you recognize that
there's racism out there,

00:01:13.492 --> 00:01:15.131
you'll start checking yourself.

00:01:15.131 --> 00:01:17.523
You'll start checking
yourself, believe it or not.

